{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Tale Told</strong> is a <strong>psychological horror</strong> anthology that brings together the stories of people who have had experiences that have marked their lives forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Last Tale Told: Spam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live alone. Work from home. You haven't been out for days, trapped by endless rain. Every day your phone rings, it's an unknown number. \u201cSuspected Scam\u201d is what you read on the screen. You think it's just spam. You hang up. But the phone rings again, and again. This is the beginning of a series of events that are about to happen to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a80b4bf992b4413fc6a14de0dd0a810e.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a80b4bf992b4413fc6a14de0dd0a810e.webm?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a80b4bf992b4413fc6a14de0dd0a810e.mp4?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigame</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pizza Pizza Faster Pizza is a game where your goal is to deliver pizzas to customers scattered throughout the levels. But be careful, as you\u2019ll encounter obstacles along the way that will prevent you from completing your deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/f2affcde8f9e70e1d2c9a8cec93cec75.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/f2affcde8f9e70e1d2c9a8cec93cec75.webm?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/f2affcde8f9e70e1d2c9a8cec93cec75.mp4?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with the environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can interact with certain elements on the map. You can also take advantage of the game\u2019s physics to grab and throw objects \u2014 and even interact with your phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a244b563acdb50fe81b9d72f2f0b8869.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a244b563acdb50fe81b9d72f2f0b8869.webm?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a244b563acdb50fe81b9d72f2f0b8869.mp4?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/42678dfc55df851219b98721a7a46b7b.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/42678dfc55df851219b98721a7a46b7b.webm?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/42678dfc55df851219b98721a7a46b7b.mp4?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys hidden around the map can be used to \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/51b6580bbfcddec551560c9adb9d2899.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/51b6580bbfcddec551560c9adb9d2899.webm?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/51b6580bbfcddec551560c9adb9d2899.mp4?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete the tasks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete simple household tasks to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/e4c56dfe38566f7d06694454c02eed96.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/e4c56dfe38566f7d06694454c02eed96.webm?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/e4c56dfe38566f7d06694454c02eed96.mp4?t=1762879529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS and CRT filters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with mobile phone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133490?t=1762879529","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/b7b45ce8bb44a39586fb63317225d5bd0a1f7580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762879529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/17a9149132df35407ec5fdc15ff0406a2c303685/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762879529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/17a9149132df35407ec5fdc15ff0406a2c303685/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762879529","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Tale Told</strong> is a <strong>psychological horror</strong> anthology that brings together the stories of people who have had experiences that have marked their lives forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Last Tale Told: Spam</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live alone. Work from home. You haven't been out for days, trapped by endless rain. Every day your phone rings, it's an unknown number. \u201cSuspected Scam\u201d is what you read on the screen. You think it's just spam. You hang up. But the phone rings again, and again. This is the beginning of a series of events that are about to happen to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133490/extras/a80b4bf992b4413fc6a14de0dd0a810e.poster.avif?t=1762879529\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/